 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Earth Manipulation — Cursed Technique Reversal, 3rd level</em></p><p>At 3rd level, as an action you can spend up to twice your cursed energy modifier to disintegrate earth, stone, or metal in a 5 ft cube that you touch, spending 2 cursed energy per cube. All materials in the cube must be touching each to be disintegrated. You can choose to destroy several 5 ft cubes as long as they are touching the cube you touched. A creature touching this ground when it is disintegrated must make a Constitution saving throw or take 2d10 necrotic damage as they experience your technique. If there is no ground beneath it, a creature standing on it falls through. Otherwise, all affected ground counts as difficult terrain. This damage increases to 3d10 at 3rd level, 4d10 at 6th level, 6d10 at 11th level, and 10d10 at 18th level.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
